# Development-only values — loaded when APP_ENV=dev, never in production.

# Links in e-mails rendered outside a request (consumer, cron commands). The
# stack's default port; with WEB_PORT remapped, set yours in `.env.dev.local`.
DEFAULT_URI=http://localhost:8080

###> AI scan (docs/architecture/ai-scan.md) ###
# The local `scan` network of compose.yaml and the container itself (the fake
# run calls in-process). A scanner started on the host arrives from the Docker
# gateway: set the whole list, with that address added, in `.env.dev.local`
# (git-ignored) — NOT in `.env.local`: Symfony loads `.env.dev` after
# `.env.local`, so this file would win. NOT a secret: a dev fixture.
SCAN_NETWORK_CIDR=172.31.250.0/24,127.0.0.1/32,::1/128
SCANNER_TOKEN=dev-scanner-token-not-a-secret-0000
###< AI scan ###
